  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>STARTING LINEUP</b>

    <size=70%>Coach''s Card</size>


    1. Our setter, <b>#7</b>, opens the game serving from Zone 1.


    2. Our opposite, <b>#12</b>, lines up directly across the court from the setter.


    3. Outside hitter <b>#3</b> starts at the net, right in front of the setter.


    4. Same roles stand opposite each other: outsides <b>#3</b> & <b>#9</b>, middles <b>#21</b> & <b>#15</b>. <b>#21</b> starts at the net.


    <size=70%><i>Across the court: 1-4, 2-5, 3-6</i></size>'
